# DESK16 "after": the stepper walks SEVEN entries on this machine (all eight of
# BUILTIN_ICONS minus the floppy, which `offered_icons` drops when the drive
# map reports no A:/B:).  Four clicks on the DOWN arrow from the hard-disk
# picture now land on the REMOVABLE DISK.  OK installs it on C:, then
# `Save desktop...` writes it to NEWDESK.INF.
#   C: icon click            (38,35)    probe run desktop dump
#   Options title hover      (196,9)    a1 run menu dump
#   "Install icon..." click  (280,27)   a1 run menu dump (entry 3.0)
#   ID_DOWN click            (334,320)  b3 run's [probe] ADINSDSK dump
#   ID_OK click              (225,369)  same dump
#   "Save desktop..." click  (280,187)  a1 run menu dump (entry 3.10)
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1500 mark A_IDLE
2600 move 38 35
2900 down
2903 up
3200 move 600 240
4000 move 196 240
4100 move 196 9
4800 move 280 27
5100 down
5103 up
5400 move 600 240
6500 mark B_DIALOG
7600 move 334 320
7900 down
7903 up
8200 down
8203 up
8500 down
8503 up
8800 down
8803 up
9100 move 600 240
10200 mark C_STEP4
11300 move 225 369
